on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  2] pusharglist 1 ........................... <1>
  [  4] extcall 50 .............................. <soundBusy(1)>
  [  6] not ..................................... <not soundBusy(1)>
  [  7] jmpifz [ 23] ............................ if not soundBusy(1) then / else
  [ 10] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 12] pusharglist 1 ........................... <1>
  [ 14] extcall 2 ............................... <marker(1)>
  [ 16] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <marker(1)>
  [ 18] extcall 3 ............................... go(marker(1))
  [ 20] jmp [ 32]
  [ 23] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 24] pusharglist 1 ........................... <0>
  [ 26] extcall 2 ............................... <marker(0)>
  [ 28] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <marker(0)>
  [ 30] extcall 3 ............................... go(marker(0))
  [ 32] ret
end
